# motrpac-human-presuspension-repro
#
# This repo is private and its readers hold consortium data access, so the
# vendored inputs under sources/ and prebuilt/ are committed. Three things are
# still kept out: pipeline outputs, run artifacts, and the handful of staged
# inputs that exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.

# ---- Run artifacts ---------------------------------------------------------
logs/
.stamps/
staging/
# Also without the trailing slash. A pattern ending in "/" matches DIRECTORIES ONLY, so a
# symlink of the same name slips past it and becomes committable. Worktrees reach these build
# dirs by symlink, so the no-slash form matters.
staging

# ---- Build outputs ---------------------------------------------------------
# Rebuilt by `make data-objects` and `make data`. Committing them would let the
# checked-in copy drift from what the pipeline produces.
scripts/**/data/
# no-slash form, for the same reason as `staging` above
scripts/**/data
scripts/00_preflight/output/
# Freeze-comparison run against v1.3: ~9.9 GB of generated reports, 12 of them
# over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit (two ATAC dream-acute diffs are ~1.5 GB
# each, four accessor .rds dumps 1.1–1.5 GB). Produced by run_diff.sh inside
# that directory, which the pattern also covers.
docs/diff_to_v1.3/
# no-slash form, for the same reason as `staging` above
docs/diff_to_v1.3

# ---- Staged inputs over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit ---------------------
# MethylCap beta-values (3 × 0.9–1.5 GB) and DA tables (3 × 0.7–1.2 GB) from
# Yongchao Ge's external pipeline; fetch with `make sources`.
**/sources/methylcap_qc_norm/
**/sources/methylcap_da/
# ATAC log-cpm matrices (2 × ~0.5 GB) and dream DA tables (2 × ~2.3 GB), staged
# from the production bucket under RERUN_ATAC=FALSE instead of being refit; same
# copy_from_source.sh groups as the methylcap pair above, so `make sources` fetches
# them too.
**/sources/atac_qc_norm/
**/sources/atac_da/
# Ensembl v105 TxDb (175 MB); rebuild with sources/ensembl_v105/build_ensembl_v105_cache.R.
**/sources/ensembl_v105/txdb_hsapiens_ensembl_v105.sqlite

# ---- Tooling ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude Code's per-repo state: settings, local permissions, and the worktrees it
# creates under .claude/worktrees/. Machine-local, not part of the pipeline.
.claude/

# ---- OS / editor / R session ------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.Renviron
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
